2
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:08,000
唸るぜ 血反吐ついたって 守りたい
I'll roar, even if I spit blood, I want to protect you,

3
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:13,100
革命道中で 君に夢中
in the midst of revolution, I'm crazy about you.

4
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:18,500
暗闇染み込む世界で見つけた
Found in a world soaked in darkness,

5
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:22,000
センチメンタルな恋
a sentimental love.

6
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:36,200
甘くのたろんだ眼差し
A sweet, languid gaze,

7
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:41,500
変に色気あるから困った
it's strangely alluring, and I'm at a loss.

8
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:46,800
手を繋ぐ勇気出したくて
Wanting to summon the courage to hold hands,

9
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:51,800
身の程わきまえてちゃ出来ないね
I can't do it if I just know my place.

10
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:57,200
暗いトンネルの壁 滴り落ちる秘密
On the walls of a dark tunnel, dripping secrets,

11
00:04:57,500 --> 00:05:03,000
しなやかに高鳴る心
a heart throbbing gracefully.

12
00:05:03,388 --> 00:05:04,488
ダメダメ
No, no!

13
00:05:04,488 --> 00:05:05,688
待て待て
Wait, wait!

14
00:05:05,838 --> 00:05:08,088
呪いも病も抱きしめたい
I want to embrace both curses and sickness

15
00:05:08,088 --> 00:05:11,188
ここらで暴れちゃってもいいかな
Is it okay if I go wild around here?

16
00:05:11,488 --> 00:05:13,188
あー唸るぜ
Ah, I'll let out a roar!

17
00:05:13,388 --> 00:05:17,688
舌打ちついたって守りたい
Even if you click your tongue, I want to protect you

18
00:05:17,888 --> 00:05:22,688
革命道中だって 君に夢中
Even in the midst of revolution, I'm crazy about you!

19
00:05:22,888 --> 00:05:28,188
暗闇染み込む世界で見つけた
In a world steeped in darkness, I found it:

20
00:05:28,488 --> 00:05:31,688
センチメンタルな恋
A sentimental love.

21
00:05:33,588 --> 00:05:37,688
なりふり構わず側にいたい
Regardless of appearances, I want to stay by your side

22
00:05:38,688 --> 00:05:42,688
不器用な君にも期待しちゃうよ
I can't help expecting things from you, clumsy as you are

23
00:05:44,188 --> 00:05:48,188
しがみつけば消えそうな火に
To a flame that seems ready to die out if clung to,

24
00:05:49,188 --> 00:05:53,188
恋の爪立てて近づいて
digging in the claws of love, I draw near,

25
00:05:54,188 --> 00:05:59,188
身を任せ抱かれて 全て失ってもいい
surrendering to your embrace, I wouldn't mind losing everything.

26
00:05:59,688 --> 00:06:04,688
しなやかに高鳴る心
My heart beats gracefully and fast.

27
00:06:05,188 --> 00:06:06,488
ダメダメ
No, no!

28
00:06:06,488 --> 00:06:07,688
待て待て
Wait, wait!

29
00:06:07,688 --> 00:06:10,088
呪いも病も君となら
With curses and sickness, if it's with you,

30
00:06:10,088 --> 00:06:13,188
ここらで暴れちゃってもいいかな
is it okay if I go wild around here?

31
00:06:13,488 --> 00:06:19,488
あー泣けるぜ 絶句しちゃうまで 離れない
Ah, it brings tears; until I'm speechless, I won't let go

32
00:06:19,488 --> 00:06:23,688
革命道中だって 君に夢中
Even in the midst of revolution, I'm crazy about you!

33
00:06:24,188 --> 00:06:29,688
彷徨う旅の狭間で見つけた
In the spaces between our wandering journey, I found it:

34
00:06:29,688 --> 00:06:33,188
センチメンタルな恋
A sentimental love.

35
00:06:33,688 --> 00:06:38,188
突き進むなら二人で
If we push forward, let's do it together

36
00:06:38,688 --> 00:06:43,688
革命道中だって 夢に熱中
Even in the midst of revolution, engrossed in our dream!

37
00:06:44,188 --> 00:06:45,688
ダメダメ
No, no!

38
00:06:45,688 --> 00:06:46,888
待て待て
Wait, wait!

39
00:06:46,888 --> 00:06:49,188
呪いも病も抱きしめたい
I want to embrace both curses and sickness

40
00:06:49,188 --> 00:06:51,688
ここらで暴れちゃってもいいよね
It's totally fine to go wild around here, right?

41
00:06:51,688 --> 00:06:53,488
怖くたって唸るぜ
Even if it's scary, I'll let out a roar!

42
00:06:53,488 --> 00:06:58,688
舌打ちついたって 守りたい
Even if you click your tongue, I want to protect you

43
00:06:58,688 --> 00:07:03,188
革命道中だって 君に夢中
Even in the midst of revolution, I'm crazy about you!

44
00:07:03,488 --> 00:07:08,688
暗闇染み込む世界で見つけた
In a world steeped in darkness, I found it:

45
00:07:09,188 --> 00:07:12,688
センチメンタルな恋
A sentimental love.

46
00:07:25,188 --> 00:07:30,188
Catch the Moment
[Song: Catch the Moment]

47
00:07:30,488 --> 00:07:32,488
いくぞー！
Here we go!

48
00:07:32,688 --> 00:07:37,188
はい！はい！はい！はい！
Hai! Hai! Hai! Hai!

49
00:07:42,488 --> 00:07:46,388
そっと吐き出す ため息を吸い込んだ
I breathed in the sigh I softly exhaled,

50
00:07:46,388 --> 00:07:50,688
後悔は苦い味残して
leaving behind a bitter taste of regret.

51
00:07:51,688 --> 00:07:56,288
いつも なんで？ 肝心なこと言えないまま
Why is it that, always unable to say what matters most,

52
00:07:56,288 --> 00:08:00,288
次の朝日が顔だしてる
the next morning sun shows its face?

53
00:08:00,688 --> 00:08:05,488
嫌になった運命を ナイフで切り刻んで
Carving up this repulsive fate with a knife,

54
00:08:05,688 --> 00:08:09,188
もう一度
if I were to start all over again,

55
00:08:09,188 --> 00:08:15,188
やり直したらキミに出会えないかも
I might never get to meet you.

56
00:08:16,888 --> 00:08:22,088
僕の声が響いた瞬間に始まる
The moment my voice resonated,

57
00:08:22,088 --> 00:08:27,188
命のリミット 心臓がカウントしてる
the limit of life began, my heart counting down.

58
00:08:27,688 --> 00:08:32,488
叶えても叶えても
No matter how many wishes come true,

59
00:08:32,688 --> 00:08:36,688
終わらない願い
the wishing never ends.

60
00:08:36,888 --> 00:08:40,088
汗をかいて走った
Sweating as I ran,

61
00:08:40,088 --> 00:08:47,388
世界の秒針は いつか止まった僕を置いていく
the world's second hand leaves behind my halted self.

62
00:08:47,988 --> 00:08:53,688
あと何回キミと笑えるの？
How many more times can I laugh with you?

63
00:08:53,988 --> 00:08:57,288
試してるんだ 僕を
It's testing me—

64
00:08:57,288 --> 00:08:59,688
Catch the Moment

65
00:09:08,188 --> 00:09:12,188
一個幸せを数えるたびに
Every time I count one piece of happiness,

66
00:09:12,188 --> 00:09:17,188
変わっていく未来に怯えてしまうけど
I find myself frightened of the changing future, but...

67
00:09:17,388 --> 00:09:24,188
愛情の種を大切に育てよう
let's cherish and nurture this seed of affection.

68
00:09:24,688 --> 00:09:31,188
分厚い雲もやがて 突き破るかな
I wonder if it will eventually break through the thick clouds.

69
00:09:32,188 --> 00:09:36,488
キミの声が響いた
Your voice resonated,

70
00:09:36,488 --> 00:09:42,488
僕の全身を通って 心臓のドアをノックしてる
passing through my whole body and knocking on my heart's door.

71
00:09:43,188 --> 00:09:48,188
「臆病」でも開けちゃうんだよ
Even if I'm "cowardly," I end up opening it,

72
00:09:48,188 --> 00:09:52,188
信じたいから
because I want to believe.

73
00:09:52,488 --> 00:09:57,488
何にもないと思ったはずの足元に
Beneath my feet, where I thought there was nothing at all,

74
00:09:57,688 --> 00:10:01,188
いつか深く確かな...
someday deep, sure [roots will grow]...

75
00:10:01,469 --> 00:10:03,669
確かな根を生やす
...it will take deep, solid root.

76
00:10:03,969 --> 00:10:08,969
嵐の夜が来たとしても
Even if a stormy night comes,

77
00:10:09,969 --> 00:10:13,069
揺らいだりはしない 何度でも
I won't ever waver, no matter how many times.

78
00:10:13,269 --> 00:10:15,669
追いついたり 追い越したり
Catching up, overtaking...

79
00:10:15,669 --> 00:10:18,469
キミがふいに分かんなくなって
Suddenly losing sight of you...

80
00:10:18,669 --> 00:10:21,969
息をしたタイミングが合うだけで
Just breathing at the exact same moment...

81
00:10:21,969 --> 00:10:25,269
嬉しくなったりして
makes me feel so happy.

82
00:10:25,469 --> 00:10:28,969
集めた一秒を
If every second we've gathered...

83
00:10:29,469 --> 00:10:31,969
永遠にして
could turn into eternity,

84
00:10:32,269 --> 00:10:36,969
行けるかな
I wonder if we can go on?

85
00:10:48,269 --> 00:10:53,669
僕の声が響いた瞬間に始まる
The moment my voice echoes out, it begins.

86
00:10:53,969 --> 00:10:59,069
命のリミット 心臓がカウントしてる
The limit of life, my heart is counting down.

87
00:10:59,269 --> 00:11:04,469
叶えても 叶えても
Even if fulfilled, even if granted,

88
00:11:04,469 --> 00:11:07,969
終わらない願い
these wishes never end.

89
00:11:08,469 --> 00:11:14,269
汗をかいて走った 世界の秒針が
I ran dripping with sweat, and the world's clock...

90
00:11:14,469 --> 00:11:18,969
いつか止まった僕を置いていく
leaves me behind whenever I come to a halt.

91
00:11:19,469 --> 00:11:25,269
あと何回 キミと笑えるの？
How many more times can I laugh with you?

92
00:11:25,969 --> 00:11:31,269
試してるんだ 僕を Catch the Moment
It's testing me... Catch the Moment!

93
00:11:31,469 --> 00:11:33,969
逃さないよ 僕は
I won't let it slip away,

94
00:11:34,069 --> 00:11:37,469
この瞬間を掴め
I'll seize this moment!

95
00:11:37,969 --> 00:11:41,469
Catch the Moment

96
00:12:06,269 --> 00:12:08,669
こんばんドドド～！
Good evening, dododo~!

97
00:12:08,869 --> 00:12:14,469
お誕生日を2回迎えることとなった角巻わためです！
I'm Tsunomaki Watame, celebrating my birthday twice!

98
00:12:14,669 --> 00:12:18,269
本当は6月6日が誕生日なんですけど、
My birthday was actually on June 6th, but...

99
00:12:18,269 --> 00:12:21,669
ぐるぐるが多くて中断、そして延期になり、
with all the buffering, it was stopped and postponed...

100
00:12:21,969 --> 00:12:27,969
今日！「角巻わため生誕祭2026 アニソンNight Fever 2」
And today, "Tsunomaki Watame Birthday 2026: Anisong Night Fever 2"...

101
00:12:27,969 --> 00:12:31,969
改めて開催させていただくことになりました～！
is officially being held anew~!

102
00:12:32,269 --> 00:12:35,269
迅速に動いてくださった運営さんたち、
To the staff who acted so quickly,

103
00:12:35,469 --> 00:12:39,069
そしてライブを観に来てくれている皆さん！
and to everyone here watching the live show!

104
00:12:39,069 --> 00:12:42,669
本当にありがとうございます！
Thank you so very much!

105
00:12:42,969 --> 00:12:47,269
1曲目『革命道中』、2曲目『Catch the Moment』と、
Starting with Song 1 "Kakumei Douchuu" and Song 2 "Catch the Moment",

106
00:12:47,269 --> 00:12:50,269
観ていただいて分かった方もいるかもしれないんですが、
some of you watching might have already realized,

107
00:12:50,269 --> 00:12:52,969
前回のライブで放送した部分は、
the parts that aired during the previous live stream...

108
00:12:52,969 --> 00:12:56,669
万が一のために録画を回してくださっていたので、
were recorded just in case, so...

109
00:12:56,669 --> 00:13:02,269
そちらの6月6日のバキバキ生誕当日のパフォーマンスを観ていただいて、
you got to see that high-energy performance from the actual birthday on June 6th!

110
00:13:02,469 --> 00:13:05,869
それ以外のその後のMCは、改めて、
And as for the MC parts after that and beyond,

111
00:13:05,869 --> 00:13:08,969
これ以上ライブ延期にならないように、
so the live wouldn't be postponed any further,

112
00:13:08,969 --> 00:13:12,969
今回は事前に収録をさせていただきました～！
we pre-recorded everything in advance this time~!

113
00:13:13,269 --> 00:13:16,969
なので、未来のリアルタイムのみんなのコメントを
So, while trying to predict everyone's real-time comments...

114
00:13:16,969 --> 00:13:19,969
予知しながらMCしたいなと思いますので、
from the future as I do this MC,

115
00:13:19,969 --> 00:13:22,969
いっぱいコメントしてください！
please send lots and lots of comments!

116
00:13:23,269 --> 00:13:26,969
うんうんうん！分かったよ、はい！はい！うん！
Yeah, yeah, yeah! Got it! Yes! Yes! Uh-huh!

117
00:13:27,469 --> 00:13:30,469
あ、ありがとうね、おめでとうもありがとう！
Ah, thank you! Thank you for the birthday wishes too!

118
00:13:30,469 --> 00:13:33,469
見える、見えるぞ～！
I can see them! I can see them~!

119
00:13:33,469 --> 00:13:34,969
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

120
00:13:34,969 --> 00:13:37,269
説明はここまで！
That's all for the explanation!

121
00:13:37,469 --> 00:13:39,669
ここからはいつものライブ！
From here on, it's the usual live show!

122
00:13:39,669 --> 00:13:43,269
今日は生誕ライブなので、たくさんこのライブに向けて
Since today is my birthday live, for this show,

123
00:13:43,269 --> 00:13:47,669
準備や練習を本当にたくさんしてきました！
I practiced and prepared so, so much!

124
00:13:47,969 --> 00:13:53,669
是非最後まで楽しんで、そしていっぱいお祝いしてもらえると嬉しいです！
Please enjoy until the very end, and I'd love it if you celebrate lots with me!

125
00:13:53,969 --> 00:13:57,069
本日のハッシュタグはこちら！
Today's hashtag is this right here!

126
00:13:57,069 --> 00:14:03,469
6月6日と変わらず、「#角巻わため生誕祭2026」になりますので、
Just like on June 6th, it's "#角巻わため生誕祭2026", so...

127
00:14:03,469 --> 00:14:07,969
たくさんスクショとか感想とかポストしてください！
please post plenty of screenshots and impressions!

128
00:14:07,969 --> 00:14:11,469
目指せ！またトレンド…ドゥルルルル…
Aim for... trending... *drumroll*...

129
00:14:11,469 --> 00:14:14,269
1位！
Number one!

130
00:14:14,469 --> 00:14:18,469
後でじっとりねっとりわためも見に行きたいと思ってますので、
Watame wants to go creep and read through all of them later,

131
00:14:18,469 --> 00:14:20,969
よろしくお願いします！
so please make lots of posts!

132
00:14:20,969 --> 00:14:24,969
では、ここまで『ダンダダン』の『革命道中』、
Now then, so far I sang "Kakumei Douchuu" from Dandadan,

133
00:14:24,969 --> 00:14:29,969
『ソードアート・オンライン』の『Catch the Moment』と歌わせていただいたんですが、
and "Catch the Moment" from Sword Art Online...

134
00:14:29,969 --> 00:14:34,669
アニメや原曲MVに関連している演出を入れ込んだりしているので、
We included effects and staging related to the anime and original MVs,

135
00:14:34,669 --> 00:14:37,269
みんな分かったかな？
so did you all catch that?

136
00:14:37,269 --> 00:14:40,269
ターボわためイトとか分かったかな？
Did you notice Turbo Watamete and everything?

137
00:14:40,269 --> 00:14:44,269
是非細かいところまで見てもらえると嬉しいです！
I hope you enjoy checking out all the fine details!

138
00:14:44,469 --> 00:14:47,969
ここからはゲストパートもあります！
From here on, we have the guest section!

139
00:14:48,269 --> 00:14:51,669
みんなの好きなアニソンも出てくるかも？
Maybe your favorite anime songs will come up too?

140
00:14:51,969 --> 00:14:56,969
ということで、ゲストパート盛り上がっていきましょう！
So with that, let's get hyped for the guest segment!

141
00:15:25,284 --> 00:15:28,584
割れた鏡の中
In the shattered mirror,

142
00:15:28,784 --> 00:15:32,584
映る君の姿
your reflected figure.

143
00:15:32,784 --> 00:15:36,584
泣いている 泣いている
You're crying, you're crying,

144
00:15:36,684 --> 00:15:40,384
細い月をなぞる指
your finger tracing the slender moon.

145
00:15:40,584 --> 00:15:44,784
誰を呼んでいるの
Who are you calling out to?

146
00:15:44,984 --> 00:15:48,784
消えた恋の背中
The fading silhouette of a lost love.

147
00:15:48,984 --> 00:15:52,784
何度でも 何度でも
Again and again, no matter how many times,

148
00:15:52,884 --> 00:15:56,584
君の窓を叩くから
I'll keep knocking on your window.

149
00:15:56,784 --> 00:16:04,184
夜の加速度に 背中押されて
Pushed forward by the acceleration of the night,

150
00:16:04,384 --> 00:16:08,284
糸が切れる様に
like a snapping thread,

151
00:16:08,384 --> 00:16:11,784
ただ、君を 君を強く
I just held you, held you tight,

152
00:16:11,884 --> 00:16:16,184
抱いてた
in my arms.

153
00:16:16,384 --> 00:16:18,984
アンバランスな
With an unbalanced...

154
00:16:19,084 --> 00:16:24,384
Kissを交わして 愛に近づけよ
...kiss exchanged, let's draw closer to love.

